@startuml
title Durable scheduling responsibility boundaries

skinparam backgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1E3A8A
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  FontColor #172554
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
}

package "schedlib" #EFF6FF {
  component "External key map" as Keys #DBEAFE
  component "Structural plan identity" as Identity #DBEAFE
  component "Typed event journal" as Events #DCFCE7
  component "Checkpoint validator" as Validator #DCFCE7
  component "Iterative resume machine" as Resume #EDE9FE
  component "Logical limits and work profile" as Limits #FEF3C7
}

package "schedlib-interop" #F0FDF4 {
  component "Canonical versioned codecs" as Codecs #BBF7D0
  component "Domain-separated digest" as Digest #BBF7D0
}

package "vinary-runtime" #FFF7ED {
  database "Durable artifacts" as Artifacts #FED7AA
  component "Atomic replace / sync policy" as Storage #FED7AA
}

package "consumer" #FDF2F8 {
  component "Task semantics" as Semantics #FBCFE8
  component "Idempotent commit sink" as Sink #FBCFE8
}

Keys --> Identity : canonical dense mapping
Identity --> Events : binds every event
Events --> Validator : validates committed prefix
Validator --> Resume : accepted state only
Limits --> Validator : item and byte claims
Limits --> Resume : work / heap bounds
Semantics --> Identity : semantic profile
Resume --> Sink : ordered logical publication

Identity --> Codecs : structural manifest
Events --> Codecs : portable records
Codecs --> Digest : canonical bytes
Codecs --> Artifacts : encoded checkpoint / journal
Storage --> Artifacts : persistence ownership
Artifacts --> Validator : decoded immutable snapshot

note bottom of Codecs #FEF3C7
No JSON, hashing, filesystem, or runtime artifact type enters schedlib's hot loop.
end note

note bottom of Artifacts #FECACA
Artifact durability remains outside schedlib; the runtime must prove its own storage protocol.
end note
@enduml
